&lt;p&gt;This is something i would like to share.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The last two weeks i took care of a 14 year old trainee at the company i'm with.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I needed to prepare something for him and by chance i stumbled over &lt;a href="https://scratch.mit.edu/"&gt;Scratch&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;IMHO this is real good stuff. We had a lot of fun. Highly recommended.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please see also &lt;a href="http://snap.berkeley.edu/"&gt;Snap!&lt;/a&gt; It looks like &lt;a href="http://www.schemers.org/"&gt;Scheme&lt;/a&gt; is not dead ;-)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Regards, Karl&lt;/p&gt;


